  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{NO}^{-}(16)-$ B.O. $-2 \\quad \\mathrm{O}_2(16)-$ B.O. $-2$ $\\mathrm{NO}^{+}(14)-$ B.O. $-3 \\quad \\mathrm{NO}(15)-$ B.O. $-2.5$ Higher the bond order lower is the bond length. Hence $\\mathrm{NO}^{+}$will have smallest bond.",
